```text
                    🌍 LIFE EVENTS
                         │
              ┌──────────┴──────────┐
              │                     │
          ❌ NOT IN               ✅ IN YOUR
          YOUR CONTROL             CONTROL
              │                     │
       • Past                    • Actions
       • Others                  • Effort
       • Opinions                • Attitude
       • Outcomes                • Response
       • Unexpected events       • Habits
              │                     │
              └──────────┬──────────┘
                         │
                 🎯 FOCUS ENERGY HERE
                         │
                  🧠 THINK CLEARLY
                         │
                  💪 ACT WITH DISCIPLINE
                         │
                   🌱 LEARN & GROW
                         │
                    🏆 LIVE WELL
```

---

# 🔑 7 Major Takeaways

### 1. 🎯 Focus on what you can control.
Don't waste excessive energy on what you cannot change.

### 2. 🧠 Protect your attention.
Your attention is one of your most valuable resources.

### 3. 🌿 Accept reality.
Acceptance allows you to respond intelligently.

### 4. ⏳ Live in the present.
Take useful action today.

### 5. 💪 Practice discipline.
Don't depend entirely on motivation.

### 6. 🗣️ Don't live for approval.
Follow your values while learning from useful feedback.

### 7. 🔥 Learn from difficulties.
Challenges can build resilience and wisdom.

